(6392745, 947279, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I think with some better lighting, this could have done better. It seems to me you are using a direct flash, which is providing some very harsh shadows and a flat image. Instead, try diffusing your light or maybe bouncing it off different surfaces to give a softer, more even look.</td>', 'Great idea. I think with some better lighting, this could have done better. It seems to me you are using a direct flash, which is providing some very harsh shadows and a flat image. Instead, try diffusing your light or maybe bouncing it off different surfaces to give a softer, more even look.', '2011-04-22 09:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
