(6393110, 946503, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and the work to merge the lightbulb into the bottle is superb. That''s why I am let down by other aspects of the photo. I would have taken the sticker off the lamp and maybe even the wire cage. Your lighting is really good too. I just can''t ignore that sticker! Giving you a 7 but would have rated you higher without the sticker and wire cage/frame of the lamp.</td>', 'This is a great idea and the work to merge the lightbulb into the bottle is superb. That''s why I am let down by other aspects of the photo. I would have taken the sticker off the lamp and maybe even the wire cage. Your lighting is really good too. I just can''t ignore that sticker! Giving you a 7 but would have rated you higher without the sticker and wire cage/frame of the lamp.', '2011-04-22 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
