(6399068, 947347, 60862, '<td valign="top">10 from me, but you might as well blame one of the 9s for not being a 10.<br/> <br/>At any rate, your artistry really shines in this.  Your straight photography is obviously excellent, but what you manage in these expert editing challenges ... c''est vraiment magnifique!<br/> <br/>And despite English not being your first language, putting 4 quite different meanings of "lightheaded" into this is simply amazing.  Especially #2!<br/> <br/>Félicitations!</td>', '10 from me, but you might as well blame one of the 9s for not being a 10. At any rate, your artistry really shines in this.  Your straight photography is obviously excellent, but what you manage in these expert editing challenges ... c''est vraiment magnifique! And despite English not being your first language, putting 4 quite different meanings of "lightheaded" into this is simply amazing.  Especially #2! Félicitations!', '2011-04-29 23:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
