(6399095, 947347, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i>"Back in June 2009, I was in search of an occupation to fill my Saturdays. Some of my friends where talking about photography at work, so I gave it a try"</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i>I consider myself as a beginner with Photoshop,</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You make me sick.... :)<br/> <br/>I cannot be more jealous of a ''beginner''.  You are truly an artist. Your material oozes originality and style, and I cannot wait to see when you are no longer a ''beginner''.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-30 00:10:56.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban:"Back in June 2009, I was in search of an occupation to fill my Saturdays. Some of my friends where talking about photography at work, so I gave it a try"  Originally posted by gyaban:I consider myself as a beginner with Photoshop,  You make me sick.... :) I cannot be more jealous of a ''beginner''.  You are truly an artist. Your material oozes originality and style, and I cannot wait to see when you are no longer a ''beginner''.', '2011-04-30 01:10:02.000000', '2011-04-30 01:10:56.000000', 0),
